WEBVTT

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:03.494
We can combine the best of both worlds
in what we call the resolution zone,

00:02:03.536 --> 00:02:06.038
shifting focus from one to the other

00:02:06.038 --> 00:02:08.916
in a dynamic and ongoing dilemma dance.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:13.713
And as we embark on this journey
towards the resolution zone,

00:02:13.754 --> 00:02:17.133
we can also think through
other outcomes or zones to avoid.

00:02:17.592 --> 00:02:20.219
There are the lopsided and top heavy zones

00:02:20.219 --> 00:02:23.681
where one value is overemphasized
at the expense of the other.

00:02:24.348 --> 00:02:26.517
There's the zone of diluted compromises

00:02:26.517 --> 00:02:29.854
where we avoid the dilemma
or deny its existence entirely.